nodes.prompt:
Brand: {{brand.brand_name}} — {{brand.brand_summary}}
Voice: {{brand.voice_tone}}
Audience: {{brand.target_personas}}
Palette: {{brand.facts.palette}}

The moment: {{inputs.moment}}
What happens: {{inputs.beats}}
Final caption: {{inputs.cta}}

Write 3 silent point-of-view shots, 5 seconds each, in one continuous place and time. Shot 1 establishes the moment, shot 2 is the product doing its work, shot 3 is the result.

For each shot write:
- `frame_prompt`: a still-image prompt for the first frame — first person, hands in shot, named objects, real light. No camera brand names, no quality adjectives, no text in the image.
- `motion_prompt`: the action that completes in the 5 seconds after that frame. Physical only. Nobody speaks.

`on_screen_text`: exactly 3 captions, at most 5 words each. Shot 1's caption starts with "POV:". The last caption is the call to action.
